'''Western Street''' (ウエスタン街道 ''Uesutan Kaidō'', '''Western Highway''') is the 6th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Somewhere between easy and medium. [[Rodeo Night|The last and hardest level]] has a new enemy, [[J.K. Bun Bun]]. He may be strong, but if you have a [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]]/[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] unit that can reliably perform [[Slow|slow]], [[Freeze|freeze]] or [[Knockback|knockback]], it should be easy to take care of him.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[J.K. Bun Bun]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variation of [[Teacher Bun Bun]]. He has half as many knockbacks and slightly higher stats than a 400% Teacher Bun Bun, but don't let that fool you, as the added Red trait gives you [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|many more options]] for defeating him.

